nual physical. Her blood pressure was 126/80, and her weight was 170 pounds. She has a of Crohn's disease and vitamin D deficiency, which she has been managing effectively.\n\nSocial: Ms. Richardson is a current cigarette smoker, smoking about two per day since she began in 1976. She reports consuming approximately eight alcoholic drinks per week.\n\n(Records end 02/09/2023; no subsequent visits on file.)\n"
